.databricks/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local-only: workshop/Genie demo assets and internal docs stay out of the
# public CI/CD demo repo. Ignore by exact name — bundle sync honors ignores
# but not `!` negations, so wildcard-plus-negation would drop synced files
# that deployed jobs need (e.g. the validation notebook).
genie/
notebooks/MarTech Lakehouse Workshop.py
notebooks/MarTech Workshop Answer Key.py
notebooks/MarTech Live CDC Demo.py
docs/*
!docs/CICD_DEMO_SCRIPT.md
!docs/CICD_RUNBOOK.md
scripts/test_workshop_contract.py
DEMO.md
TASKS.md
uv.lock
